Value Slot (\d+)
Value Filldown VERSION (.+)
Value HARDWARE (\S+)
Value MASTER (M|S)

Start
  ^ZXR10
  ^ZTE.+Software,\s+Version:\s+${VERSION},\s+Release\s+software
  ^Copyright
  ^Built
  ^System
  ^$$ -> SHELF

SHELF
  ^\[MPU\(${MASTER}\),\s*shelf\s*${Slot},\s*panel\s*\d+\]
  ^Board Name\s+:\s${HARDWARE}
  ^$$ -> Continue.Record
